---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="页面不存在">
  <div class="wrap page-header" style="min-height:52vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;">
    <span class="crumb">404 / 页面不存在</span>
    <h1>这里没有东西。</h1>
    <p>地址打错了，或者内容被移动、下架了。常用的三个去处：</p>
    <div class="hero-actions" style="margin-top:22px;">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">回首页</a>
      <a href="/library" class="btn btn-ghost">内容库</a>
      <a href="/tools" class="btn btn-ghost">工具站</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
